    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just keep thinking about how they remember me. they remember the perfect version of me. if i stay like this... this broken version... that's all they'll ever see. it feels like the only way to keep that version of me alive, instead of letting them watch me fail over and over, is to just... stop. i don't want to be a disappointment. i'd rather they just remember me as I was.",
